GetParameter.json is the response body of GetParameter on the public
parameter /aws/service/ami-amazon-linux-latest/al2023-ami-kernel-default-x86_64
in us-east-1.

Shape: the AWS Systems Manager API Reference, GetParameter, Response
Syntax and Examples (its LastModifiedDate is an epoch number with a
fraction, as 1582657288.8 there):
https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/APIReference/API_GetParameter.html

Values: the parameter's name, and its account-less ARN, from the
Systems Manager User Guide, "Calling AMI public parameters":
https://docs.aws.amazon.com/systems-manager/latest/userguide/parameter-store-public-parameters-ami.html
The AMI id is the AWS documentation's example id (ami-0abcdef1234567890);
the version and date are illustrative. Never fakeaws output.
